==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-harelip.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|teratology|lang=en}} A congenital malformation of the [[upper]] [[lip]], reminiscent of the mouth of a hare.

====Synonyms====
* [[cleft lip]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb|harelips|harelipping|harelipped}}

# {{context|teratology|lang=en}} To curse (as if by causing a harelip),
#:''I don't care if it '''harelips''' the governor.''
#:''I'm gonna get them doors open if it '''harelips''' everybody on Bear Creek!''

